1.0.2

- A fresh install now opens straight onto a word card: the most common
  built-in words are started automatically, instead of "Nothing to study".
- The card queue keeps going past your own words into new ones.
- If there is truly nothing left, Done opens the library instead of
  appearing to do nothing.
- Sign in with Apple now works (the capability was missing from the build).
- Sign in with Google (shown once a Google client ID is configured).
